# Manager files only: ignore everything at the root, then allow the few files the manager needs.
# Project folders are their own repos (or loose assets) and never show up here.
# .claude/harness.json (your settings), the rendered worker settings and the manifest stay ignored.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
!/.claude/scripts/
!/.claude/docs-templates/
!/.claude/setup/
!/.claude/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
